 "about_text": "Baert Gallery is a Los Angeles gallery founded in 2016 by Christian Baert. Its program centers on emerging to mid-career artists working across installation, sculpture, painting, video, and performance, with a stated focus on complex, intellectually rigorous, and formally challenging practices. The gallery provides studio and production support to its artists, including artist publications and regular live performances. After a decade based in the Los Angeles Arts District, Baert Gallery moved to a new space in the Melrose Hill neighborhood in 2026, a move described as intended to expand opportunities for its artists and broaden its community.",
